{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人胡定欣、陳山聰、張馳豪與黃庭鋒等，今日（15日）參與2公里賽跑賽事；</p><p>而陳敏之與兒子雷子樂亦有現身支持。</p><p>胡定欣笑言變了陳山聰「背後的女人」，本身打算邊跑邊打卡的她，結果上橋後發現「天都未光」，幸得山聰帶領，順利完成賽事。</p><p>山聰聞言後笑言：「</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T13:41:50.911803+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T13:10:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:15.274970+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:15.274970+00:00","content_hash":"43fb74fcc3c470df91600d193b121f197e47d98bbdbddd98741865d55a15683b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}